WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:01.520
Last time on...

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:02.980
<i>Love Live! Sunshine!!</i>

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.440
Mandarin oranges!

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.070
The day before the school closing festival,
the Uranohoshi students

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:10.030
worked hard to make it the best event ever.

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:12.390
Oh, it's Shiitake-<i>chan</i>...

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.410
We were happy. We were humbled.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.240
It was warm. It was dazzling.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:20.330
We wished that day would last forever...

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:23.710
But all things must come to an end.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:27.080
And now we finally arrive at...

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:28.830
...our destination.

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:41.470
Do you have everything?

00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:43.270
I do.

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:46.060
It was a wonderful
school closing festival, wasn't it?

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:48.310
Yep. All the more reason

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:51.530
that we should give
everything we've got at the finals.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:58.410
Riko-<i>chan</i>!

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:04.830
You're right.
We've practiced so hard for this.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:10.040
It's true that we worked hard
from early in the morning

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:13.260
until after the sun had already set.

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:15.060
We all did our Rubesty!

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:22.510
Even still, we never
skipped practice even once.

00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:23.850
Though we did whine about it sometimes.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:31.400
"Be Earnest"

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:34.030
We were really sleepy in the morning,
<i>zura</i>... Right, Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>?

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:37.450
It's Yohane! That's my little demons for you.

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:38.490
I praise you all!

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:40.320
Thanks.

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:49.670
"Ura High"

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:51.420
We're heading out!

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:53.300
We're heading out!

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:11.310
<i>Let's throw our all at each other</i>
<i>and grab hold of the future!</i>

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:21.950
<i>The sky and this ocean are both on our side</i>

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:25.910
<i>Shining and saying, "Go, do your best!"</i>

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:32.630
<i>To let our voices reach far, far away</i>

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:37.550
<i>Shall we shout our dreams louder?</i>

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:39.300
<i>(Full of hope)</i>

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:43.640
<i>Today pulls tomorrow toward itself</i>

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:52.230
<i>It's really fun to grasp the magnet</i>
<i>in my heart and run right now!</i>

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:54.360
<i>(Let's always go together)</i>

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:57.150
<i>What shall we do about the future?!</i>

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:04.950
<i>Everyone laughs and cries</i>
<i>as</i> <i>they</i> <i>look for the shape of their dreams</i>

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:13.380
<i>Because I'm sure the</i> <i>future</i> <i>us</i>
<i>will have the answer</i>

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:21.470
<i>Let's run with everything we have</i>
<i>and become the shining wind</i>

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:24.800
<i>We got dream</i>

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:30.390
"#12 'Sea of Light'"

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:32.900
Sis...

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.560
I'm fine now.

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:36.730
What do we do now?

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:38.980
The finals won't be till tomorrow.

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.280
You want to go to Bukuro, right, Lili?

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:43.200
What?! Wh-Where's that?!

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:46.030
--Bukuro?
--Bukuro is... Ah!

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:49.410
--Silent cherry blossom nightmare...!

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:52.210
--She really is turning into Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>, <i>zura</i>.
--Silent cherry blossom nightmare...!

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.960
Well then, shall we go pay a visit first?

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.840
"Myojinotoko-zaka"

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.060
Oh!

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.060
It's beautiful as always!

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:14.230
Those were some steep stairs, <i>zura</i>.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:17.520
But don't you think coming up
was easier compared to last time?

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:18.730
Now that you mention it...

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:22.280
Growth is something
you don't notice until afterwards.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:24.450
Okay, then! Let's pray!

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:30.660
I hope our feelings will reach
everyone in the audience.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:32.710
I hope I can perform
with everything I've got.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:35.210
I hope I won't be nervous.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.290
I hope I won't say "<i>zura</i>."

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:40.170
I hope joy will come to all my little demons.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.510
I hope we can sing in a way...

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:46.430
...that conveys the feelings
of everyone at Uranohoshi.

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:49.970
I hope our performance tomorrow
will be the best one ever.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:53.930
I hope... we win Love Live.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.400
<i>Zura</i>!

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:02.820
--Wow...
--Wow...

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:04.240
--What is it?
--Look at this.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:07.240
"May Aqours win" "Supporters at
Uranohoshi Girls' High School, November"

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:07.240
This is...

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:10.030
Look at this one, too!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.120
They came here for us...

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.580
"May Aqours win" "Supporters at
Uranohoshi Girls' High School, January"

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:15.870
"May Aqours win" "Supporters at
Uranohoshi Girls' High School, December"

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:16.830
They came... several times...

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.580
"May Aqours win" "Supporters at
Uranohoshi Girls' High School, November"

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:20.790
They came here without telling us...

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:25.010
As I said before,
all the students at our school are cool.

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:26.760
"We'll win Love Live!" "Aburiko Apricots"

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:31.160
Chika-<i>chan</i>...! This is...

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:33.270
There's another one here.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:36.520
"We're gonna win no matter what!"
"Umine Otome"

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:39.270
This many school idols came here to pray...

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:39.270
"We won't lose" "We'll give our
best performance" "Ninmari DAYS"
"We'll make everyone's smiles even brighter" "Aim to perform in Love Live!"

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:42.270
"May our efforts come to fruition"
"We'll win Love Live for sure"
"Piyolist" "We'll do our best to be No. 1"
 "Green Teas" "Win Love live!"
 "Cream Kibun" "Win Love Live!!"
 "We hope we can do our best with a smile!!!"

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:41.870
There are so many, <i>zura</i>.

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:45.190
It's not just us...

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.480
They gather here hoping to win.

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:50.780
It's been a while.

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:53.580
--Sarah-<i>san</i>!
--Leah-<i>chan</i>!

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:56.370
You've finally made it here.

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:58.250
If you're scared, you'll lose.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:05:59.580
We know that!

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:03.380
The Akiba Dome will be different
from the past venues, <i>zura</i>.

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:05.630
I can't even imagine
what the place will be like.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:11.100
I still can't believe that I was able
to sing on that stage, either.

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:14.220
Everywhere I looked,
there were lights sparkling.

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:17.850
It was as if I was floating above the clouds.

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:19.900
Above the clouds...

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:21.310
So...!

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:24.530
I'm not gonna forgive you if you
give a half-baked performance!

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:28.780
Of course I won't! I'll do my Rubesty!

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:30.820
Let's sing together again.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.410
--Yep!
--Hey! Ruby is Yohane's
Little Demon Number Four!

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.080
--Those smiles are wonderful.
--Hey! Ruby is Yohane's
Little Demon Number Four!

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.330
--Yes!
--Hey! Ruby is Yohane's
Little Demon Number Four!

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:36.700
--When I met you guys for the first time
--Hey! Ruby is Yohane's
Little Demon Number Four!

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:40.420
I thought, "They look so weak."

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:43.630
But looking at you now, I think,

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:46.390
"They show so much promise."

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.630
Do you want to win?

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:56.020
You asked me the same question before.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:59.770
Do you want to win Love Live?

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:01.650
And...

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:06.090
...who are you performing in Love Live for?

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:10.030
"Homei Inn"

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:11.910
"Back to the Piyoko Manju Part II"

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:15.330
Whoa! This <i>manjū</i> is... Ah!

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:21.030
This is really fun! It's like
we're taking another school trip!

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:24.170
This is, indeed, destiny!

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.670
She's quite pleased, <i>zura</i>.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.310
How unseemly!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:33.890
It was like this when we participated
in the concert last time, wasn't it?

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:35.550
Yeah.

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:39.180
Since we got people's attention,
I thought we might be pretty good.

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:41.390
But the reality was...

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.510
You're already feeling fainthearted?!

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.110
Should we practice?

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.030
We'll be fine.

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:54.490
Let's have faith in everything
we've done up to this point.

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:58.700
All I can say is that
I don't think we can lose.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:03.230
We win Love Live...

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.720
...and make the name Uranohoshi
part of Love Live history...

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.420
That's what this is all about, right?

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:14.580
That's...

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:25.270
You-<i>chan</i>?

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.820
What're you doing?!

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:34.210
--Shining Tornado...!
--How'd you like that?!

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:37.240
This is cool!

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:42.000
I won't be able to do this
once I go to Italy, so... Take this!

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:46.710
What're you doing to my little sister?!

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.700
And, the Love Live finals are tomorro--

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:54.760
Wow, you sure have
let yourself go, haven't you, Dia?

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:57.890
--Now... you've... done... it!

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:58.680
--Sis...
--Now... you've... done... it!

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:01.220
You're really going to get it now!

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:02.470
That's the spirit!

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:03.480
Shiny!

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:04.600
--<i>Zura</i>...!
--All right! Take this!

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:06.940
What in the world is up with these three?

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:12.070
They have a long-standing argument
over who's the best at pillow fights.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.240
How childish...

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.740
Look who's talking, Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>, <i>zura</i>.

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:16.410
It's Yoha--

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:19.450
That does it!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:22.240
I won't lose!

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.330
Chika-<i>chan</i>.

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:25.330
Do you feel better?

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:29.590
Don't you think that it's cool that
we're doing this the day before the finals?

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:33.170
It's just like our normal... selves!

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:43.020
"Homei Inn"

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.590
Shiny!

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:40.760
--You guys are amateurs!
--All right! I'll use my Rubesty throw!

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.320
--Here I come!
--Take this!

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:48.190
That was pretty crazy.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:50.610
It was your fault, You-<i>chan</i>.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:53.500
Although it's spring,
it still gets pretty cold, doesn't it?

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.400
Did you want to go visit there?

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:58.240
--What?
--Otonokizaka.

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.160
You did?

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:02.930
A little bit.

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:07.420
I wanted to see how I feel
about things after all this time.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.540
Then let's stop by tomorrow.

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:13.630
No, it's okay. We have to
perform tomorrow, so...

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:14.920
But you are...

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:18.630
Then, why don't we just
meet up at the venue tomorrow

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:20.430
so we have free time before that?

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:20.930
What?

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:24.600
Each of us has our own free time.
We'll go wherever we want to go.

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.410
That's a good idea!

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:27.180
But...

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:29.940
Each of us will spend time alone

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:33.330
to reflect on ourselves before
the performance. I want to do it, too, so...

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:38.620
Okay... Let's do it.

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:42.880
<i>Love Live! Sunshine!!</i>

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:47.160
This place really is impressive!

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:49.870
Are they really going to sing
in a place like this?

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:51.630
I wonder if they'll be able
to hear our cheers...

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:57.420
They will! We'll root for them
so loudly that they can hear!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:58.590
That's right.

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:01.550
It's not just the Uranohoshi students.

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:04.500
Everyone from Uchiura is here, too!

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:07.170
What?

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.730
"Uchiura Group Bus No. 1"

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:09.730
Okay, everyone!

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:13.900
Are you ready to become the number one
supporters in the whole universe?!

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:16.160
Yeah!

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:19.110
"Tochiman" "Restaurant"

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:19.110
Come to think of it, where's Shiitake-<i>chan</i>?

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:21.700
Shiitake is holding the fort this time.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:25.700
"Otonokizaka High School"

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.470
Hanamaru-<i>chan</i>...

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:48.770
Do you... want to win?

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:49.930
<i>Zura</i>?

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:52.270
Do you want to win Love Live?

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:55.770
Ruby-<i>chan</i> and I reading
books alone in the library

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:59.440
was always enough to make me happy.

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:03.990
But thanks to you and the others,
I was able to venture to the outside world,

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:08.330
which allowed me to realize that I could
do a lot of things if I'm with you all.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:11.040
So I want to win, <i>zura</i>.

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:13.960
Nothing else could bring me
more joy right now, <i>zura</i>.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:19.160
Chika-<i>chan</i>, thanks for inviting me
to join your school idol group!

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:25.470
I couldn't do anything on my own before,

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.470
"School Idol Shop"

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:27.970
but I am a school idol now.

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:30.220
That alone makes me happy.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:34.190
Of course, this is the last
Love Live event for the third years,

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:36.230
so I'd like us to win...

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:39.980
But right now, being able to sing
with you all, whom I love so much,

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:41.290
makes me happier than anything!

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:45.750
What?! Are you stupid?

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:48.580
Of course I want to win!

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:53.500
I must demonstrate my great power to all
the little demons throughout the world!

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:58.960
That fearsome power is crucial
to achieving victory at Love Live.

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:01.460
Very well, then.

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:04.710
I suppose this fallen angel
can stay fallen a little longer.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:08.200
Thank you... Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>.

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:11.810
It's Yohane!

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:16.940
Why are you asking that now?

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:23.440
We've worked so hard
to come this far, so I'd like to win.

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:25.810
But more than that, I'd like to enjoy it.

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:29.820
I'd like to enjoy my last
performance with Mari and Dia.

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:35.140
The truth is, the thought that it'll be over
after this... makes me feel relieved.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.540
That's exactly why I want us to win...

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:45.760
...so that I can enjoy this moment
in time all the more.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:53.970
You're asking if I want to win?

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.560
As the director,

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:01.400
I feel that we have to win for the sake
of all the Uranohoshi students

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:04.550
as well as for the school
that is so deeply loved.

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:08.200
But if I can be a bit selfish...

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.990
...I want to win as a member of Aqours.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:18.040
This is a rare chance for the nine of us
to do something incredible together!

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.710
Shiny!

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.630
Of course I want us to win.

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:31.640
We came here with the feelings of all
the Uranohoshi students on our shoulders,

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:33.850
so we will win!

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:42.110
Also, I want to sing with all my heart
as Dia Kurosawa of Aqours.

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:46.650
No matter where we perform,
I want my singing to come from the heart.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:49.700
My pride as a school idol rests on it!

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:54.700
The day of the Love Live finals
has finally come!

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:59.710
Which group will be crowned victorious?!

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:07.450
Here!

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:09.350
You-<i>chan</i>...

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:13.390
What're you doing here?

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:14.910
Hm?

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:20.060
I wanted to see this for some reason...

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:21.730
You, too?

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:23.020
What? Then...

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:24.230
Yeah...

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.990
...because this is where everything started.

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:06.480
I wonder if I can find...
the shine that I wanted to find then...

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:10.110
I'm sure you will... soon...

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:13.310
It won't be long now... for sure...

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:14.900
Do you want to win?

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:18.650
Do you want us to win... Love Live?

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.470
Of course.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:27.040
This is something I was
finally able to do together with you.

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:31.300
So it's okay for you to be your normal self.

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:36.860
You don't have to be afraid of the future.

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:43.350
You're not alone, Chika-<i>chan</i>!

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:45.650
Thank you.

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:48.480
Ah! Riko-<i>chan</i>!

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:51.030
Were you able to play the piano?

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:53.650
Of course!

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:56.780
Do you want to win Love Live, Riko-<i>chan</i>?

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:57.940
Yeah!

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:05.330
I truly felt that I chose the right path
from the bottom of my heart.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:10.160
You saved me when I was having
a tough time and ran away from the piano.

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:14.760
I realized that meeting you
and the others was indeed a miracle.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:18.790
So I want to win...
I want us to win Love Live!

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:22.470
I want to prove that I made the right choice!

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:26.010
This moment in time! With all my might!
From the bottom of my heart!

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:30.480
I want to be a school idol!

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:39.740
What about you, Chika-<i>chan</i>?

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:40.640
Do you want to win?

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:47.960
That paper...

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:51.920
We turned a zero into a one,
and moved forward one step at a time.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:54.510
It's okay to stay the way I am, right?

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:56.970
Because I was normal,
and I was a normal monster,

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:58.430
I am who I am now, right?!

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:00.760
I want to do my best and win, too!

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:04.060
I'm going to win and find my shine!

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:17.200
Thank you... Bye-bye.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:19.160
We're okay now.

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:20.450
Shall we go, Chika-<i>chan</i>?

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:22.950
Yep!

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:27.410
What'd you write on the votive tablet?

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:29.650
That is a secret.

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:33.340
But what I wrote...

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:36.840
"I hope Aqours wins" "Dia Kurosawa"

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.760
...will come true.

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:36.840
Come to think of it,

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:41.550
when I was going to transfer,
you wrote a wish, too...

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:43.400
That we would be together forever.

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:46.000
See, what did I tell you?

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:52.350
Really? We're going to be separated soon.

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.150
We'll be together...

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:58.070
...because the sky is connected...

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:02.490
No matter how far apart we are...
we'll always be together!

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:04.280
Even if our eyes don't see it...!

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:08.500
Now, let's go!

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:14.800
Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>...?

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:15.980
It's Yohane!

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.380
There's something I want to tell you.

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:19.780
You too, Ruby.

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:22.840
What is it, <i>zura</i>?

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.600
What else? It is about our contract.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:28.560
Even after Love Live is over
and our school is closed,

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:31.310
--the contract with Yohane--
--You don't have to worry.

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:35.820
The contract among you, me,
and Ruby-<i>chan</i> is absolute, <i>zura</i>.

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:38.190
Even after we're at a new school.

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:42.320
Hmph! Why are you saying
my line without permission?

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:43.170
Thank you!

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:45.700
--What?
--I'm really grateful-uby!

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:56.130
My heart is kinda going pitter-patter!

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:58.130
I wonder how big the place is...!

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:00.920
It's hard to even imagine, isn't it?!

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:02.320
<i>Zura</i>!

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:04.770
We're right on time.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:08.890
So the Dome lies ahead of here, right?

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:12.100
That's right.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:16.860
Akiba Dome... It's one of
the biggest halls in the country.

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.610
The Love Live finals!

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.820
I wonder how far we've run...

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:26.950
I wonder how far we've come...

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:28.590
I wonder how far this will continue...

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:32.960
I don't know the answers, but because of
our thoughts both then and now--

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:36.090
because of all of them, I think
we were able to get where we are now.

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:40.920
Sarah-<i>san</i> said it's like being above
the clouds! Like we're flying in the sky!

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:44.260
Let's enjoy this as much as
we possibly can! Let's go all out!

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.100
And let's win!

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:50.720
In order to find our own shine and proof!

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:52.400
Now, here we go!

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:53.940
One!

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:55.060
Two!

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:56.190
Three!

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:57.310
Four!

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:58.440
Five!

00:20:58.730 --> 00:20:59.570
Six!

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:00.690
Seven!

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:01.940
Eight!

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:03.070
Nine!

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:05.820
From zero to one!

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:08.200
And from one to something even greater!

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:15.960
Aqours...! Sunshine!

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:24.380
<i>Now</i> <i>is</i> <i>now,</i>
<i>and it's different from yesterday</i>

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:30.260
<i>It's not halfway to tomorrow, now is now</i>

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:35.730
<i>As these moments pile up, they disappear</i>

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:41.820
<i>I</i> <i>carve</i> <i>them</i> <i>into my heart, WATER BLUE</i>

00:22:03.340 --> 00:22:08.800
<i>I swam here through the</i>
<i>world that opened up before me</i>

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:13.600
<i>After</i> <i>I</i> <i>decided I didn't want regrets</i>

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:15.020
<i>"I won't give up!"</i>

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:19.560
<i>Just</i> <i>saying</i> <i>that</i>
<i>won't</i> <i>make anything come true</i>

00:22:19.560 --> 00:22:20.610
<i>"Move!"</i>

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:25.030
<i>I</i> <i>learned</i> <i>that things will change</i>
<i>if I take action</i>

00:22:25.030 --> 00:22:30.570
<i>I</i> <i>want</i> <i>to</i> <i>stay here forever</i>

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:36.080
<i>But</i> <i>I</i> <i>know I'll depart on a journey one day</i>

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:41.130
<i>That's</i> <i>why I want to make this time fun</i>

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:50.470
<i>Because I want to sear</i>
<i>the</i> <i>greatest</i> <i>thrills</i> <i>into my heart</i>

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:53.430
<i>MY NEW WORLD</i>

00:22:53.430 --> 00:22:57.940
<i>The</i> <i>time has come to find a new place</i>

00:22:57.940 --> 00:23:03.360
<i>I'll</i> <i>cross the ocean to find the next shine</i>

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:08.860
<i>Since our desire to dream</i>

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:14.160
<i>Will</i> <i>always</i> <i>connect us, I'll go with a smile</i>

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:23.540
<i>Let's</i> <i>pile on the "nows"</i>
<i>and head for the future!</i>

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:39.210
Next Time! "Our Own Shine."

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:41.500
"#13 'Our Own Shine'"
